  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;d f&#xF6;r utv&#xE4;rdering och projektbeskrivning runt dammar</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support evaluation and project formulation around dams</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen syftar till att :
1) Utv&#xE4;rdera insatsen &quot;project for the reduction of small dams vulnerability to climate change (PRVPB-CC)&quot;
2) Anv&#xE4;nda resultaten fr&#xE5;n utv&#xE4;rderingen till att hj&#xE4;lpa Burkina Fasos jordbruksministerium att formulera ett projektdokument f&#xF6;r den f&#xF6;reslagna insatsen &quot;Project for the agricultural use of small dams (ProValAB)&quot;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contribution aims to:
1) Perform the final evaluation of the project (PRVPB-CC)
2) Use the evaluation results to assist the Ministry of Agriculture in Burkina Faso to formulate the project document of the proposed &quot;Project for the agricultural use of small dams (ProValAB)&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
